    <string name="guide_controls">Basic controls</string>
    <string name="guide_rules_text">Choose a folder that holds GBA, GBC and GB games, such as Roms or Emulation/Roms. An empty folder gets those folders created. Supports extracted .gba, .gbc and .gb files up to 64 MiB.</string>
    <string name="guide_games_text">Import games on this device, open Slot Manager to generate labels and covers, or switch to Connect to upload from a browser.</string>
    <string name="guide_game_count">Games · %1$d</string>
    <string name="guide_connect">Upload from computer</string>
    <string name="guide_download">Download RetroArch</string>
    <string name="guide_core_text">In RetroArch, open Online Updater → Core Downloader and install mGBA for GBA, GBC and GB. Return to Slot and insert a cartridge to play.</string>
    <string name="guide_controls_text">Swipe left/right to choose a cartridge; %1$s/%2$s switches categories.\nPress %3$s or swipe down to insert; press %4$s or swipe up to eject.\nPress Select or hold the centre cartridge to open its menu.</string>
